;------------------------------------------------------------------
; bb_gfx.z80s - GENERATED by bubble/tools/bbgfx.py, do not edit by hand
;
; Compiled sprites: straight-line code, one instruction sequence per
; byte, chosen offline from that byte's transparency. Access counts
; in the right margin are exact, so the per-object figures in
; docs/BUBBLE_BOBBLE_SAM.md can be checked against the real code.
;------------------------------------------------------------------

